              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "I forgot my Asquala login password — how do I reset it?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "If you have forgotten your Asquala login password (also searched as 'Asquala login password'), go to the Askuala Link login page at app.askualalink.com and click 'Forgot Password.' Enter your registered email address or phone number and you will receive a password reset link or OTP. If you are a student or parent, contact your school administrator — they can reset your Askuala account credentials from the admin dashboard."
              }
            }
